{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026FpAhYREW2e1793109341.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>葡萄牙超級足球聯賽，賓菲加作客2-1反勝辛達卡拉。</p><p></p><p>黑衫的賓菲加上半場輸十二碼，森美爾達侯禁區內犯手球，雷斯費蘭度32分鐘射入，為辛達卡拉半場領先一球。</p><p></p><p>賓菲加換邊後，先靠柏夫利迪斯接應橫傳，62分鐘近門撞入成1-1，交出助攻的比列斯甸安尼，4分鐘後中路硬闖，禁區邊射入，為賓菲加反勝2-1，取得各項賽事四連勝，聯賽排第二。</p><p></p><p>雙方賽後爆發衝突，賓菲加的祖漢杜蘭領紅。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T14:44:14.532368+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":183,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T13:54:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T15:38:16.538197+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T14:40:25.771510+00:00","content_hash":"2a4e13a8af40eef64e2929133b4103232e3d67b9d7a5525ec950b3b3cf359c16","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-27T14:44:14.532368+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}